Suggests: tclsh, wish
Conflicts: ivy-tcl, ivy-cpp
Replaces: ivy-cpp
Provides: ivy-cpp (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Ivy software bus - C and C++23 runtime libraries
 Native and GLib shared libraries for the C API and C++23 wrapper,
 together with the Ivy command-line tools and manual pages.
 Ivy is mostly a communication convention between processes, implemented
 through libraries in several languages and for several platforms,
 from C to Perl, from Macintosh or WindowsNT to Linux or Unix.
